ge deployment.\n- This task has released M4. No further sync/deploy/promote is planned or pending; the Site Knowledge task may take ownership.\n- Existing operator tunnel was retained.\n\nProduction branch remains `2af00741a2ce06ea56a78e62864d4a35d86c66ab`; no production deployment, secret change or production host operation occurred.\nRollback: revert the merged frontend change through a master PR.\n\nM4_OBSERVATION_RECEIPT date=2026-10-16; route=Pgy direct; sync=not measured; focused=9.97s accepted smoke,56.84s regression; promotion=88.74s; operations=candidate_sync:4,promotion:1,deploy:0; stable_502=not measured; m4_only=not occurred; coordination=not occurred\n",
